---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout page="privacy">
  <!-- ── Privacy Policy ──────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section--dark legal-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="section-title section-title--tight">Privacy <span>Policy</span></h1>

      <div class="legal">
        <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: October 2, 2026</p>

        <p>This policy explains what information this website collects, why, and what you can do
        about it. It applies to <strong>desertelitehomesandconstruction.com</strong>, operated by
        Desert Elite Homes &amp; Construction (AZ ROC 353956), a residential contractor serving
        Scottsdale, Cave Creek, Carefree, Phoenix, and the surrounding area.</p>

        <p>We keep this short and specific on purpose. We do not sell your information, and we do
        not use it for anything other than what is described below.</p>

        <h2>Information you give us</h2>
        <p>If you submit the quote request form, we collect what you type into it:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>First and last name</li>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>City</li>
          <li>The service you are interested in</li>
          <li>Your project timeline</li>
          <li>Whatever you write in the message field</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We use this only to respond to your enquiry and to discuss the work you asked about.
        We do not add you to a mailing list, and we do not sell, rent, or trade it.</p>

        <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
        <p>Like most websites, this one records some technical information when you visit:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Which pages you viewed and how long you stayed</li>
          <li>The website or search that sent you here</li>
          <li>Your general location, at the city or region level, estimated from your IP address</li>
          <li>Your device type, browser, and screen size</li>
        </ul>
        <p>This is aggregate information about how the site is used. It is not used to identify
        you personally, and we do not attempt to link it to a named individual.</p>

        <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>We use Umami, a privacy-focused analytics service, to understand how many people visit
        the site and which pages are useful to them. Umami does not use cookies and does not
        track you across other websites.</p>
        <p>We do not currently respond to browser "Do Not Track" signals, because there is no
        agreed standard for what that response should be. The site works normally either way.</p>
        <p>We do not use advertising cookies, and we do not run retargeting or remarketing.</p>

        <h2>Services we rely on</h2>
        <p>Running this site involves a few third parties. Each one receives only what it needs
        to do its job:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Netlify</strong> hosts the website and processes form submissions. Their
          servers keep standard access logs.</li>
          <li><strong>Umami</strong> provides the visitor statistics described above.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> and <strong>Cloudflare</strong> deliver the fonts and
          icons the pages are built with. Loading any file from another server necessarily reveals
          your IP address to it, which is how the web works rather than a choice we made about
          your data.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Each of these companies handles data under its own privacy policy.</p>

        <h2>How long we keep things</h2>
        <p>Quote requests are kept as business records for as long as they may be relevant to a
        current or prospective project, and in line with normal record-keeping for construction
        work. Analytics data is retained on a rolling basis under the settings of the analytics
        account. If you would like your enquiry deleted sooner, just ask.</p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to
        delete it. Contact us using the details below and we will handle it. There is no charge,
        and you do not need to give a reason.</p>

        <h2>Security</h2>
        <p>The site is served over an encrypted HTTPS connection, so what you submit through the
        form is protected in transit. No website can promise perfect security, but we do not store
        payment details or sensitive personal records on this site at all, which keeps the risk low.</p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>This site is intended for adults arranging construction work. We do not knowingly
        collect information from children under 13. If you believe a child has submitted
        information through this site, contact us and we will remove it.</p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted on this page with a new
        date at the top. Material changes to how we handle information will be reflected here
        before they take effect.</p>

        <h2>Contact us</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy, or requests about your information, can be sent through
        our <a href="contact.html">contact page</a>.</p>
        <p>Desert Elite Homes &amp; Construction<br>
        AZ ROC 353956<br>
        Serving Scottsdale, Cave Creek, Carefree, Phoenix, and the Greater Area</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
